# KEYS: Openbox

## Menu & Window Navigation

| Key | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| **W-Space** | Open Root Menu |
| **A-Space** | Open Client Menu (Active Window) |
| **A-S-Space** | Open Combined Client List Menu |
| **C-A-Space** | Open Application Menu |
| **W-Tab** / **A-Tab** | Switch to Next Window |
| **W-d** | Toggle "Show Desktop" |

---

## Desktop & Workspace Management

| Key | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| **C-A-Left** / **Right** | Go to Previous/Next Desktop |
| **W-equal** | Add a New Desktop |
| **W-minus** | Remove Last Desktop |
| **W-S-Left** / **Right** | Send Active Window to Previous/Next Desktop |

---

## Window Manipulation

### Movement & Resizing
* **W-A-Arrows** - Move window relative to current position
* **W-C-Arrows** - Resize window relative to current size
* **W-A-m** - Interactive Move (Notification)
* **W-A-r** - Interactive Resize (Notification)

### State Toggles
* **A-F4** - Close Window
* **A-F5** - Iconify (Minimize) Window
* **A-F6** - Toggle Maximize
* **A-F7** - Toggle Shade (Roll up)
* **A-F8** - Toggle Decorations (Borders/Titlebar)
* **A-F9** - Toggle Omnipresent (Visible on all desktops)
* **A-F10** - Toggle Fullscreen
* **A-F11** - Toggle Always On Top
* **A-F12** - Toggle Always On Bottom

---

## System & Screenshot Tools

| Key | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Print** | Take Screenshot (Immediate) |
| **A-Print** | Take Screenshot (5s Delay) |
| **S-Print** | Take Screenshot (10s Delay) |
| **C-Print** | Take Screenshot of Active Window |
| **W-Print** | Take Screenshot of Selected Area |
| **C-A-l** | Lock Screen |
| **C-S-R** | Reload Openbox Configuration |
| **C-S-Backspace** | Restart Openbox |
| **C-A-Delete** | Exit Openbox |

---

## Application Launchers

### General
* **A-F1** - Rofi Application Launcher
* **W-r** - Rofi Run Command
* **W-x** - Rofi Power Menu
* **W-s** - Rofi Screenshot Tool
* **W-n** - Network Manager (Dmenu)
* **W-o** - Launch GUI Applications
* **W-F1** - Open Help Popup

### Software & Tools
* **W-w** - Brave Browser
* **W-m** - Min Browser
* **W-f** - Thunar File Manager
* **W-e** - Geany Text Editor
* **C-A-v** - Neovim
* **W-p** - Color Picker
* **W-g** - Garuda Welcome
* **W-h** - Btop (as Root)
* **W-j** - JDownloader
* **W-v** / **W-c** - Video Cutting Tools (Flawless/Lossless)
* **C-A-s** - Simple Screen Recorder
* **C-A-h** - Gnome Disks
* **C-A-g** - Music Player

### Terminals
* **C-A-t** - Xfce Terminal
* **C-W-Return** - Terminal (as Root)
* **C-A-r** - LF File Manager (in Alacritty)

